= Integrative and Personalized Treatment Approaches
<ch:integrative-treatment>

#roadmap(title: [How to Use This Chapter])[
*For patients*: start with the developing-a-treatment-plan section and treating-comorbidities section to build a structured plan; the working-with-healthcare-providers section helps you coordinate care.

*For caregivers*: read the treatment-planning and working-with-healthcare-providers sections to help organise the treatment plan and communicate effectively with the clinical team.

*For clinicians*: read the personalized-medicine, combination-therapies, and severity-stratified metabolic-reserve-building-protocol sections to tailor treatment to the individual patient.

*For researchers*: the novel-mechanistic-hypotheses and cross-domain-medical-parallels sections, plus the thermoregulation math-model extensions, define the testable research directions.
]
